#. What the npc says when the party talks to it.
msgctxt "npc.alchemist.line"
msgid "Potions, elixirs, and an essence that bends space. What will it be?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "npc.blacksmith.name"
msgid "Blacksmith"
msgstr ""

#. What the npc says when the party talks to it.
msgctxt "npc.blacksmith.line"
msgid "Fresh from the forge! A sturdy hammer keeps you standing for longer."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "npc.elder.name"
msgid "Elder"
msgstr ""

#. What the npc says when the party talks to it.
msgctxt "npc.elder.line"
msgid "Long ago a goat chewed up a wizard's spellbook and swallowed its magic. The Goat Wizard now rules the lair down south. Beat it, and its bees may answer your call."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "npc.elf.name"
msgid "Elf"
msgstr ""

#. What the npc says when the party talks to it.
msgctxt "npc.elf.line"
msgid "The forest whispers of strangers who outwit goats and bats alike. Walk softly, travellers: my arrows watch over this village."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "npc.farmer.name"
msgid "Farmer"
msgstr ""

#. What the npc says when the party talks to it.
msgctxt "npc.farmer.line"
msgid "Thank you for dealing with that bat! My village is just south, past this meadow. Mind the bats nesting off the path."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "npc.herbalist.name"
msgid "Herbalist"
msgstr ""

#. What the npc says when the party talks to it.
msgctxt "npc.herbalist.line"
msgid "Herbs to heal, venom to kill: I know them both. Take me with you, and let's face that goat together!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "npc.princess.name"
msgid "Princess"
msgstr ""

#. What the npc says when the party talks to it.
msgctxt "npc.princess.line"
msgid "You defeated the Goat Wizard! The realm thanks you, brave travellers. This was only the first of many paths: keep exploring this world."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "npc.viking.name"
msgid "Viking"
msgstr ""

#. What the npc says when the party talks to it.
msgctxt "npc.viking.line"
msgid "Those beasts kept me pinned here for days! For Valhalla, I fight at your side."
msgstr ""

